      "side": 1,
      "message": "My one hesitation with this is their [doc on file systems](https://h2database.com/html/advanced.html#file_system) says `async: experimental file system`. I don\u0027t know how \"experimental\" they really consider it though. The full recommendation is to use a client/server model instead of the embedded model. I think we also have this problem with Lucene and we do something to protect the threads from being interrupted, so perhaps we could apply that to h2 too.",
